    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout showcasing the political tensions in India. The central image features a stylized graphic representing a halted public transit system in Delhi (perhaps a metro or bus stopped), with subtle background elements hinting at protest signs and a gavel symbolizing Supreme Court intervention. On the side, smaller inset images or graphical elements depict a crowd protesting in a regional setting (like Kalaburagi) and a silhouette of a leader under house arrest. Use a color palette of deep blues, reds, and grays to convey seriousness and urgency. The overall style should be professional, newsroom-quality, and visually impactful for a news article, avoiding any specific faces to maintain neutrality.",
