    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split composition. On one side, a dynamic, downward-trending cryptocurrency chart with red indicators, symbolizing market volatility and price dips for Bitcoin, Ethereum, and XRP, set against a subtle, blurred background of a global financial district. On the other side, an overlay of abstract, official-looking documents with faint governmental seals and digital lock icons, representing regulatory clampdowns and institutional scrutiny. A subtle digital globe overlay visually connects these themes, hinting at global impact in regions like the US, UK, EU, India, Canada, and Australia. The overall mood is serious, analytical, and informative, not sensational, using a color palette of deep blues, greys, and subtle reds.",
