      neutralCase: "Hyperscale Data progresses with its expansion plans, but SMR integration faces moderate delays, pushing back full operational capacity. AI demand remains strong, but increased competition and energy cost fluctuations temper profitability. Regulatory actions continue, creating a more defined but still cautious operating environment for crypto-related infrastructure, leading to steady but not explosive growth for Hyperscale Data.",
