      potentialCatalysts: ["Successful capital raise or partnership for SMR development.", "Faster-than-expected regulatory approvals for SMRs or data center expansions.", "Continued exponential growth in AI computing demand.", "Favorable policy shifts towards nuclear energy for data centers.", "Significant increase in Bitcoin price, boosting profitability of \'anchored\' operations."],
      keyRisks: ["Inability to secure necessary financing or regulatory approvals for SMRs.", "Unexpected technical challenges or cost overruns in data center construction.", "Adverse changes in cryptocurrency regulation or enforcement actions.", "Intensified competition in the AI data center market.", "Prolonged volatility or downturn in the Bitcoin market."],
