    outlook: "The immediate outlook for Wall Street is cautiously optimistic, underpinned by the recent tech rebound and stable macro factors. However, this optimism is tempered by the critical data releases scheduled for the coming week. A favorable earnings season and signs of moderating inflation could sustain the upward momentum, potentially paving the way for a more robust year-end rally. Conversely, disappointing earnings or persistent inflation could trigger renewed market volatility and a re-evaluation of current valuations. The Federal Reserve\'s messaging will be paramount in shaping investor sentiment.",
