    risks: ["Continued regulatory pressure from IMF and other international bodies on El Salvador\'s Bitcoin policy.", "Volatility of Bitcoin posing financial risk to El Salvador\'s national treasury and public finances.", "Potential for future conditionalities on aid tied to crypto policy changes.", "Reputational risks for El Salvador if its Bitcoin experiment faces significant challenges or regulatory conflicts.", "Uncertainty regarding the long-term economic benefits and stability derived from Bitcoin as legal tender."],
