      bearCase: "The increasing regulatory pressure on privacy features, coupled with persistent security vulnerabilities and widespread fraud, could significantly impede crypto adoption. A fragmented and overly restrictive regulatory environment, combined with a lack of trust due to scams and breaches, might deter both retail and institutional investors, leading to slower growth or even contraction in certain segments.",
