      potentialCatalysts: ["Development of privacy-enhancing technologies that satisfy regulatory compliance requirements.", "Successful legal precedents set against crypto fraud, improving platform integrity.", "Significant advancements in DeFi security auditing and insurance mechanisms.", "Clear and harmonized global regulatory frameworks for stablecoins and privacy tools."],
      keyRisks: ["Outright bans or severe restrictions on privacy-enhancing crypto technologies by major jurisdictions.", "Major, systemic security breach impacting a large segment of the DeFi ecosystem.", "Failure of social media platforms to effectively combat crypto-related fraud, leading to sustained reputational damage.", "Unfavorable court rulings in ongoing crypto-related legal battles."],
