      institutionalAdoption: "Institutional adoption of Dogecoin has been limited compared to Bitcoin or Ethereum, primarily due to its memecoin status and inflationary supply. However, the DogeOS initiative could be a step towards attracting more institutional interest if it proves successful in building a robust DeFi ecosystem. The MSCI rule debate highlights institutional scrutiny of companies holding crypto assets, including those that might hold DOGE.",
