      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a 50% probability of a \'Neutral\' outcome, characterized by continued regulatory evolution, ongoing security challenges, and steady technological progress. A \'Bullish\' scenario has a 35% probability, driven by significant institutional adoption facilitated by clearer regulations and breakthrough innovations from platforms like Ethereum. A \'Bearish\' scenario holds a 15% probability, primarily due to widespread restrictive regulations or a series of major security breaches severely impacting market trust and liquidity.",
