      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a high probability of Anthropic successfully listing on Nasdaq, likely achieving a robust valuation, albeit potentially adjusted from the ambitious $2 trillion target. The immediate impact on San Francisco\'s housing market will be significant and negative for affordability. The long-term outlook for Anthropic and the AI sector remains positive, but with increasing regulatory oversight and market competition. A 60% probability of strong IPO performance, 30% probability of moderate performance with valuation adjustments, and 10% probability of significant underperformance.",
